<p>Yes, that is indeed a typo that i intend to correct as soon as i get my hands on my computer again.</p>
<p>The whole point of the interview is to show that the community is not absolutely passive. The formal English tone used by the entity shows that the overall intelligence among the society is u.nusually high. The second point of the interview is to show that they actually know that they have the ability to turn a whole continent into a mass of anomalous plastic humanoids.</p>
<p>The bravado and the tone of the doctor gradually increase as a response to the intimidation done by the interviewed entity. He is basically attempting to go toe to toe and failing.</p>

