<p>I guess where the dialog falters is that the entity doesn't really sound particularly threatening. His tone strikes me more like Pedantic College Professor Who Knows More About This Topic Than You But Is Overall Not That Smart.</p>
<p>Have you read the dialog aloud? Both characters are talking to each other but it doesn't have much natural flow from them both generally not answering/responding directly to each other.</p>
